.TH "FISH\-CONFIG" "7" "June 2026" "" "Fish Shell Configuration User Manual"
.SH NAME
fish\-config \- personal fish shell configuration for Fish 4.x with
modern CLI tool integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
